ula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{C}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nThere are $100$ floors, so $n=100.$ We want to select $5$ of those floors for the elevator to stop, so we have $r=5.$\n\nTherefore, the number of choices is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{100}{C}_{5} & =\\frac{100!}{(100-5)!\\,5!} \\\\  & =\\frac{100!}{95!5!} \\\\  & =\\frac{100\\cdot 99\\cdot 98\\cdot 97\\cdot 96\\cdot \\cancel{95!}}{\\cancel{95!}5!} \\\\  & =\\frac{100\\cdot 99\\cdot 98\\cdot 97\\cdot 96}{5\\cdot 4\\cdot 3\\cdot 2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\,034\\,502\\,400}{120} \\\\  & =75\\,287\\,520.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246517 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246518 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246519 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246520 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246521 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1041 "selection" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246519 13194139533682 true] [17592186246516 1110 #uuid "d23bb508-6c11-5d10-a042-339fc62e53fe" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246517 1034 "500" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246517 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246517 1111 #uuid "c8320cd8-1189-519f-bdae-4fad34e05f6e" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246518 1034 "{100}^{5}" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246518 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246518 1111 #uuid "ba31d0ec-cffb-5a55-9d7a-df3a6c23f6bc" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246519 1034 "75\\,287\\,520" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246519 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246519 1111 #uuid "e8a318bf-d8f3-5090-a136-c3673db7ff97" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246520 1034 "9\\,034\\,502\\,400" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246520 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246520 1111 #uuid "5703ad61-c051