186246536 1138 false 13194139533682 true] [17592186246536 1145 "The number of combinations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{C}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nThere are $8$ players, so $n=8.$ We want to select $4$ of those players for the team, so we have $r=4.$\n\nTherefore, the number of different selections of four players is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{8}{C}_{4} & =\\frac{8!}{(8-4)!\\,4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{8!}{4!4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\cdot 7\\cdot 6\\cdot 5\\cdot \\cancel{4!}}{4!\\cancel{4!}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\,680}{24} \\\\  & =70.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246538 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246539 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246540 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246541 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246542 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1041 "selection" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246538 13194139533682 true] [17592186246537 1110 #uuid "eb5aad70-ff14-5267-ba93-06ef81065813" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246538 1034 "70" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246538 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246538 1111 #uuid "2f78f54f-26ea-5197-ab42-f400bef5cdd5" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246539 1034 "64" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246539 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246539 1111 #uuid "57dda641-157c-5859-976b-3084560d9589" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246540 1034 "20" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246540 1111 #uuid "0ec67c81-1de6-5583-b8c0-874db8812b22" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246541 1034 "32" 13194139533682 true] [17592186246541 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533682 true] [17592186246541 1111 #uuid "c6462dcc-e97a-5897-b06c-8fb92df